---
/**
 * The admin's marker for "this owner asked for a Dutch-speaking agent"
 * (properties.dutch_agent_requested). Solid navy so it is the one thing on a
 * card or row that is impossible to miss; the wording is Hungarian like the
 * rest of the admin screens.
 */
---
<span class="dutch-badge"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="6.25" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" /><path d="M1.75 8h12.5M8 1.75c1.9 1.8 2.9 3.9 2.9 6.25S9.9 12.45 8 14.25C6.1 12.45 5.1 10.35 5.1 8S6.1 3.55 8 1.75Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" /></svg>Holland ingatlanos</span>
<style>
  .dutch-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 5px;
    padding: 2px 9px 2px 7px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--cream);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: var(--fw-medium);
    line-height: 1.5;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
</style>
